---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="相册" active="photos">
  <p class="page-eyebrow">PHOTO JOURNAL / MEMORIES</p>
  <h1 class="page-title">把时间留在照片里。</h1>
  <p class="page-description">未来可以按日期、旅行和主题浏览相册，照片与日记双向关联。当前版本不自动暴露本地的照片目录。</p>
  <section class="photo-placeholder">
    <span class="photo-icon">▧</span>
    <h2>相册模块 · 准备中</h2>
    <p>此仓库暂时公开，真实照片会保留在被 Git 忽略的 Attachments/ 目录。后续接入经过授权的图片存储和缩略图生成。</p>
    <a class="button" href="/diary">先从日记开始 ↗</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
